*> PERFORM VARYING with an UNTIL condition the counter cannot satisfy.
*> Counters stored in binary, conditions with AND or OR, and counters
*> that can reach the limit are not reported.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LOOPS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  I                   PIC 99.
01  J                   PIC 999 COMP-3.
01  K                   PIC 99 COMP.
01  S                   PIC S99.
01  DONE-FLAG           PIC X VALUE "N".
01  CELLS.
    05  CELL            PIC X OCCURS 99 TIMES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 99
        MOVE "A" TO CELL (I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 98
        MOVE "B" TO CELL (I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM FILL-CELL VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J = 1000
    PERFORM FILL-CELL VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J IS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO 1000
    PERFORM FILL-CELL VARYING K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL K > 99
    PERFORM FILL-CELL VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 99 OR DONE-FLAG = "Y"
    PERFORM FILL-CELL VARYING I FROM 99 BY -1 UNTIL I < 0
    PERFORM FILL-CELL VARYING S FROM 9 BY -1 UNTIL S < 0
    STOP RUN.
FILL-CELL.
    CONTINUE.
